# experiments_log/.gitignore
# Keep dated *.md, dated experiment logs, scripts, and the summary JSON
# under experiments_log. Mute the per-seed wrapper/job-noise files and
# LaTeX aux/out artefacts.

# Per-seed H10 wrapper + log.err noise (job scaffolding).
_*.py
_*.log.err
_*.done
_*.ps1
_*.md
_*.ps1.done

# LaTeX aux/out artefacts (committed PDFs are kept, intermediates are not).
*.aux
*.out
*.toc
*.log
*.fls
*.fdb_latexmk
*.synctex.gz
